-- hinh ky cuoc se bao "0 hoa don" trong khi bang hoa_don co 112 dong.
--
-- Ky 5 DA_CHOT: day la thu chan huyBillingKy() va huyRatingKy() dong thoi
-- voi viec da co thanh toan. Ky 6 va ky 7 van MO.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
